le=\"color: #000000;\">At Welcome Post We Create, we make ideas happen to bring change and transformation. We</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">provide a uniquely vibrant, collaborative platform that helps bring great ideas to life.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>WHAT WE BELIEVE</strong></span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Every company is born in this world with its work, and our job is to transform the world. We shape</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">organizations, economies, and society to solve challenges. We believe in finding a way motivated by</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">opportunities and necessity when we come together.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Have you been here before?</span></p>\n<p>[/vc_wp_text][la_btn title=\"WELCOME\" color=\"three\" size=\"sm\" align=\"center\" el_class=\"aboutWelcomeBtn\" link=\"url:https%3A%2F%2Fwelcomepost.co.ke%2F|||\"][vc_column_text el_class=\"contactlink\"]<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><a class=\"contactlink\" style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://welcomepost.co.ke/contact-us/\">Contact us</a></strong></span>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_row el_class=\"show-small-only\"][vc_column width=\"7/12\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\"]<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We analyze ideas, create content and products, create systems, and build companies on them. We do so to our thoughts and to institutions, governments, companies, and individuals who partner us and undertake this journey with us.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in Entrepreneurship, Technology, and Music as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.</span>[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1567277024713{background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Subscribe to Our Blog Via Email\" title_color=\"#ffffff\" subtitle_class=\"subscribeParagraph\"]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Enter your email address to subscribe to this blog and receive notifications of new posts by email.</p>\n<p>[/la_heading][vc_column_text el_class=\"mailInput\"][yikes-mailchimp form=\"1\"][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:80px;\"][la_heading title=\"Meet Our Team\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-10\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\" el_class=\"element-max-width-600 element-align--center\"]Praesent sed ex vel mauris eleifend mollis. Vestibulum dictum sodales ante, ac pulvinar urna sollicitudin in. Suspendisse sodales[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:55px;xs:25px;\"][la_team_member style=\"7\" per_page=\"6\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" height_mode=\"custom\" height=\"94%\" img_size=\"full\" column=\"xlg:3;lg:3;md:2;sm:2;xs:1;mb:1;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column width=\"5/6\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" offset=\"vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8 vc_col-sm-offset-1\"][la_divider height=\"lg:65px;\"][la_heading title=\"What Client Say ?\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2\"][/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:20px;\"][la_testimonial style=\"4\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" column=\"xlg:1;lg:1;md:1;