hrough the big meaningful projects.[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:110px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:60px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"7/12\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\"]We analyze ideas, create content and products, create systems, and build companies on them. We do so to our thoughts and to institutions, governments, companies, and individuals who partner us and undertake this journey with us.\r\n\r\nWe are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in Entrepreneurship, Technology, and Music as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.\r\nWe are starting as a small independent blog looking forward to morphing into a recognized media platform, offering unique opportunities for the creation of new ideas, products, and content to institutions, governments, and individuals.\r\nAll we have to do now is to start, bearing in mind that ideas don’t come out fully formed, they only become clear as you work on them. We have to start, and may the source of strength who has blessed the ones before we help us find the courage to make our lives a blessing.[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"5/12\"][vc_single_image image=\"842\" img_size=\"full\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:85px;md:50px;xs:0px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"1362\" img_size=\"full\" onclick=\"custom_link\" link=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/172601404?autoplay=1\" el_class=\"la-popup image-with-icon-play icon-play-at-bottom-right\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 p