ertake this journey with us.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in Entrepreneurship, Technology, and Music as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.</span>[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1567277024713{background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Subscribe to Our Blog Via Email\" title_color=\"#ffffff\" subtitle_class=\"subscribeParagraph\"]</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Enter your email address to subscribe to this blog and receive notifications of new posts by email.</p>\r\n<p>[/la_heading][vc_column_text el_class=\"mailInput\"][yikes-mailchimp form=\"1\"][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][la_social_link][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:80px;\"][la_heading title=\"Meet Our Team\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-10\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\" el_class=\"element-max-width-600 element-align--center\"]Praesent sed ex vel mauris eleifend mollis. Vestibulum dictum sodales ante, ac pulvinar urna sollicitudin in. Suspendisse sodales[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:55px;xs:25px;\"][la_team_member style=\"7\" per_page=\"6\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" height_mode=\"custom\" height=\"94%\" img_size=\"full\" column=\"xlg:3;lg:3;md:2;sm:2;xs:1;mb:1;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column width=\"5/6\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" offset=\"vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8 vc_col-sm-offset-