ip</strong>, <strong>Technology</strong>, and <strong>Music</strong> as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.\r\n\r\nWe are starting as a small independent blog looking forward to morphing into a recognized media platform, offering unique opportunities for the creation of new ideas, products, and content to institutions, governments, and individuals.\r\n\r\nAll we have to do now is to start, bearing in mind that ideas don\'t come out fully formed, they only become clear as you work on them. We have to start, and may the source of strength who has blessed the ones before we help us find the courage to make our lives a blessing.[/la_heading][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1567279170825{margin-top: 20px !important;}\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" spacer=\"line\" spacer_position=\"middle\" line_height=\"4\" title=\"Technology.\" line_width=\"xlg:100px;lg:150px;\" line_color=\"#000000\"]There is only one thing stronger than all the armies of the world: and that is an idea whose time has come.[/la_heading][la_heading alignment=\"left\" spacer=\"line\" spacer_position=\"middle\" line_height=\"4\" title=\"Entreprenuership.\" line_width=\"lg:200px;\" line_color=\"#000000\"]The potential for innovation is infinite. There is always the opportunity to invent something completely new or build something that is better or cheaper than what already exists. There is no limit on what entrepreneurship and ingenuity can create.[/la_heading][la_heading alignment=\"left\" spacer=\"line\" spacer_position=\"middle\" line_height=\"4\" title=\"Music.\" line_width=\"lg:150px;\" line_color=\"#000000\"]Any good music must be an innovation.\r\n\r\n[/la_heading][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_row el_class=\"show-small-only\"][vc_column width=\"7/12\"][la_head