 them. We do so to our thoughts and to institutions, governments, companies, and individuals who partner us and undertake this journey with us.\r\n\r\nWe are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in <strong>Entrepreneurship</strong>, <strong>Technology</strong>, and <strong>Music</strong> as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.\r\n\r\nWe are starting as a small independent blog looking forward to morphing into a recognized media platform, offering unique opportunities for the creation of new ideas, products, and content to institutions, governments, and individuals.\r\n\r\nAll we have to do now is to start, bearing in mind that ideas don\'t come out fully formed, they only become clear as you work on them. We have to start, and may the source of strength who has blessed the ones before we help us find the courage to make our lives a blessing.[/la_heading][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1567279170825{margin-top: 20px !important;}\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title=\"Technology.\" title_class=\"pr-item\"]There is only one thing stronger than all the armies of the world: and that is an idea whose time has come.[/la_heading][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title=\"Entreprenuership.\" title_class=\"pr-item\"]The potential for innovation is infinite. There is always the opportunity to invent something completely new or build something that is better or cheaper than what already exists. There is no limit on what entrepreneurship and ingenuity can create.[/la_heading][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title=\"Music.\" title_class=\"pr-item\"]Any good music must be an innovation.[/la_heading][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_row el_class=\"show-small-only\"][vc_column width=\"7/12\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\"]<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We analyze ideas, create content and products, create systems, and build companies on them. We do so to our thoughts and to institutions, governments, companies, and individuals who partner us and undertake this journey with us.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in Entrepreneurship, Technology, and Music as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.</span>[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1567277024713{background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Subscribe to Our Blog Via Email\" title_color=\"#ffffff\"]Enter your email address to subscribe to this blog and receive notifications of new posts by email.[/la_heading][vc_column_text el_class=\"mailInput\"][yikes-mailchimp form=\"1\"][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][la_heading title=\"Contact Us.\"][/la_heading][contact-form-7 id=\"1306\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:80px;\"][la_heading title=\"Meet Our Team\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-10\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\" el_class=\"element-max-width-600 element-align--center\"]Praesent sed ex vel mauris eleifend mollis. Vestibulum dictum sodales ante, ac pulvinar urna sollicitudin in. Suspendisse sodales[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:55px;xs:25px;\"][la_team_member style=\"7\" per_page=\"6\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" height_mode=\"custom\" height=\"94%\" img_size=\"full\" column=\"xlg:3;lg:3;md:2;sm:2;xs:1;mb:1;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column width=\"5/6\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" offset=\"vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8 vc_col-sm-offset-1\"][la_divider height=\"lg:65px;\"][la_heading title=\"What Client Say ?\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2\"][/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:20px;\"][la_testimonial style=\"4\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" column=\"xlg:1;lg:1;md:1;sm:1;xs:1;mb:1;\"][la_divider height=\"lg:40px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]','About Us','\n						','inherit','closed','closed','','1559-revision-v1','','','2020-01-26 13:24:37','2020-01-26 13:24:37','',1559,'http://welcomepost.co.ke/1559-revision-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(2623,4,'2020-02-21 16:56:14','2020-02-21 16:56:14','','WELCOME-POST','','inherit','open','closed','','welcome-post','','','2020-02-21 16:56:14','2020-02-21 16:56:14','',0,'http://welcomepost.co.ke/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/WELCOME-POST.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3492,4,'2020-04-12 11:45:59','2020-04-12 11:45:59','<p>[vc_section css=\".vc_custom_1567279782647{margin-bottom: 80px !important;}\"][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" full_height=\"yes\" columns_placement=\"top\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"top\" el_class=\"row--maxwidth-1440\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1586691704676{padding-top: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"2/3\"][la_heading alignment=\"inline\" use_gfont_title=\"yes\" subtitle_class=\"three-font-family\" subtitle_color=\"#ffffff\" title_font=\"font_family:Dosis%3A200%2C300%2Cregular%2C500%2C600%2C700%2C800|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\"]</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\"><b>About</b></span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\">At Welcome Post We Create, we Make Ideas Happen, bring Change and Transformation.</span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\">Welcome Post provides Economic, Political, and Social data, news, and transformative insights. We communicate accurate information powered by technology, our data systems, and our people\'s capabilities. We work in and with a uniquely vibrant and collaborative ecosystem model across the company to deliver value to our clients. </span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\"><b>What We Believe</b></span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\">No company is born in this world whose work is not born with it, and our work is to transform the world. When we come together, we shape organizations, economies, and society to solve challenges. We believe in finding a way motivated by opportunities and necessity. </span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\"><b>What we do</b></span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\">Welcome post connects and clarifies the world on a single platform. We communicate reliable and accurate real-time Economic, Political, and social information that help solve the worlds defining challenges. </span></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><span lang=\"en-US\">Have you been here before?</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_row el_class=\"show-small-only\"][vc_column width=\"7/12\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\"]<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We analyze ideas, create content and products, create systems, and build companies on them. We do so to our thoughts and to institutions, governments, companies, and individuals who partner us and undertake this journey with us.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">We are scared, excited, and eager to create as we document our experiences about our creative work in Entrepreneurship, Technology, 