neurship, Technology, and Music as we endeavor to connect and change the world. Like any other adventure, there are opportunities, lessons, and challenges, and we share them with you in this blog.</span>[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:30px;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1567277024713{background-color: #000000 !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][la_heading alignment=\"left\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-20\" subtitle_color=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Subscribe to Our Blog Via Email\" title_color=\"#ffffff\"]Enter your email address to subscribe to this blog and receive notifications of new posts by email.[/la_heading][vc_column_text el_class=\"mailInput\"][yikes-mailchimp form=\"1\"][/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column][la_divider height=\"lg:80px;\"][la_heading title=\"Meet Our Team\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2 padding-bottom-10\" subtitle_color=\"#5d5d5d\" el_class=\"element-max-width-600 element-align--center\"]Praesent sed ex vel mauris eleifend mollis. Vestibulum dictum sodales ante, ac pulvinar urna sollicitudin in. Suspendisse sodales[/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:55px;xs:25px;\"][la_team_member style=\"7\" per_page=\"6\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" height_mode=\"custom\" height=\"94%\" img_size=\"full\" column=\"xlg:3;lg:3;md:2;sm:2;xs:1;mb:1;\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column width=\"5/6\" la_animation_duration=\"1\" la_animation_delay=\"0\" la_animation_iteration_count=\"1\" offset=\"vc_col-md-offset-2 vc_col-md-8 vc_col-sm-offset-1\"][la_divider height=\"lg:65px;\"][la_heading title=\"What Client Say ?\" title_fz=\"xlg:36px;\" title_class=\"letter-spacing--2\"][/la_heading][la_divider height=\"lg:20px;\"][la_testimonial style=\"4\" enable_carousel=\"yes\" column=\"xlg:1;lg:1;md:1;sm:1;xs:1;mb:1;\"][la_divider height=\"l